  <Thumbnail>6be45114-ef16-4d66-97f1-8b44595cf3d0</Thumbnail>
  <History Date="20-11-21" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created (pixel layout not documented - guessed)" Version="0" />
  <History Date="25-03-22" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Updated in line with rev 4 charts (revises all existing control function ranges and adds new control functions/macros).  Note these are currently different to the latest manual available (rev 2)." Version="11" />
  <History Date="25-03-22" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Thoroughly checked all other elements and found everything is exact match and agree with current Capture simulation.  Pixel layout now documented and guess was correct." Version="11" />
  <History Date="26-08-22" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added multi-part patch options for the 97 and 74 channel modes." Version="12" />
  <History Date="20-09-22" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Corrected 3rd part name of 74 channel mode multi-part option (previously the 2nd and 3rd part both said 'plate'.  the 3rd part now says 'beam')" Version="13" />
  <History Date="27-10-22" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Updated in line with latest documentation (Rev 6) (adds 47 channel mode)" Version="14" />
  <History Date="02-11-22" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added 47 channel mode Atlabase ID." Version="15" />
  <History Date="06-03-24" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Updated in line with latest documentation (Rev 7) (adds 68 channel mode)" Version="16" />
  <History Date="08-03-24" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase IDs for 68 channel mode." Version="17" />
  <History Date="20-05-24" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added multi-part patch options for the 68 channel mode." Version="18" />
  <History Date="20-08-24" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created from Chauvet Color STRIKE M (identical)" Version="19" />
  <History Date="22-08-24" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's." Version="21" />
  <History Date="11-10-24" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created from LED2 XP.14 (identical)" Version="22" />
  <History Date="16-10-24" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's." Version="23" />
  <History Date="17-10-24" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added missing Atlabase ID for 47 channel mode." Version="24" />
  <History Date="13-03-25" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created from CLF Nero (identical, obviously. nothing original to see here)" Version="25" />
  <History Date="14-03-25" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's." Version="26" />
  <History Date="10-04-25" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created from Mitek Strike M1400 IP (identical.  charts in documentation are clearly copied straight from Chauvet)" Version="27" />
  <History Date="10-04-25" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created from Expolite TourCyc Sirius Move (effectively idenical except addition of frost.  hopeless documentation - barely readable.  channel counts in charts don't match specs)" Version="28" />
  <History Date="10-04-25" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="(Beam patterns not documented properly and don't make sense.  12 channel mode doesn't make any sense.  made best guess)" Version="28" />
  <History Date="11-04-25" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's." Version="29" />
  <History Date="11-04-25" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Fixed multi-part modes (added frost)" Version="30" />
